#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/MSMR.ipynb:533
msgid ""
"Below we show how to set up and solve a CCCV experiment using the MSMR model "
"in PyBaMM. We already created the model in the previous section, so we can "
"go ahead and define our experiment, before creating and solving a simulation"
